 > In the plane of fire, is there any way to get out of the lava?  I
 > tried levitation, and it said that you are still stuck.  I didn't have
 > any wands of cold so i couldn't try this...

Don't know about the planes, as I never have got that far.  But I got stuck
in lava on a quest level, and getting out wasn't difficult.  Just keep
moving, and you'll get loose after a while.  It is just like a pit or a bear trap.
(Hope the level isn't filled completely with lava, or you'll get stuck again
and again and again...)  A wand of cold will cool a few squares of lava.
You may also push/drop boulders, sometimes they will make solid ground.

